WEBVTT

00:08:58.526 --> 00:09:02.484
and in the coming years, they want 
one billion people to have smartphones

00:09:02.484 --> 00:09:07.773
and help people in rural India 
to understand technology

00:09:07.773 --> 00:09:11.183
and use technology to improve their lives.

00:09:11.183 --> 00:09:15.553
OK, Sundar, you are running 
perhaps one of the biggest companies,

00:09:15.553 --> 00:09:19.553
so some questions on leadership
all the youngsters would like to know.

00:09:19.553 --> 00:09:21.373
One of the questions is,

00:09:21.373 --> 00:09:24.880
what does it take to lead a company
like Google in today's day and age

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.713
from a leader's point of view?

00:09:26.713 --> 00:09:30.063
and --two things-- does it feel 
like a big responsibility